WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.070
I went into orbit around asteroid Eros on Valentine's Day 2000.

2
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:16.950
A year later the team decided to try something bold: land me, even though I had no legs.

3
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:23.750
I touched down at walking speed and kept sending science from the surface for two more weeks.

4
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:29.960
I was never built to land, but I touched down on an asteroid anyway.
